# SOLVER
GeneralStatic intervals 100

# DOMAIN
Plane2D

# NODES
Node 1 coords 3 0.0 0.0 0.0
Node 2 coords 3 1.0 0.0 0.0
Node 3 coords 3 0.0 1.0 0.0

# ELEMENTS
Truss 1 nodes 2 1 2
Truss 2 nodes 2 2 3
Truss 3 nodes 2 1 3

# MATERIALS
LinearElastic 1 E 210e9 nu 0.3 set 4
LinearElastic 2 E 210e9 nu 0.3 set 5
LinearElastic 3 E 210e9 nu 0.3 set 6

# CROSSSECTIONS
GeneralCS 1 A 1.00e-4 Ix 8.33e-10 set 4
GeneralCS 2 A 1.00e-4 Ix 8.33e-10 set 5
GeneralCS 3 A 1.00e-4 Ix 8.33e-10 set 6

# BOUNDARYCONDITIONS
BoundaryCondition 1 PieceWiseLinearFunction 1 dofs 2 1 2 0 0 set 1
BoundaryCondition 2 PieceWiseLinearFunction 2 dofs 1 1 0 set 3

# FORCES
Force 1 PieceWiseLinearFunction 3 dofs 1 2 -1000 set 3
Force 2 PieceWiseLinearFunction 4 dofs 1 1 1000 set 2

# SETS
Set 1 nodes 1 1
Set 2 nodes 1 2
Set 3 nodes 1 3
Set 4 elements 1 1
Set 5 elements 1 2
Set 6 elements 1 3

# LOADTIMEFUNCTIONS
PieceWiseLinearFunction 1 steps 1 points 2 0 1 values 2 0 1
PieceWiseLinearFunction 2 steps 1 points 2 0 1 values 2 0 1
PieceWiseLinearFunction 3 steps 2 points 3 0 0.33 1 values 3 0 1 1
PieceWiseLinearFunction 4 steps 2 points 3 0 0.66 1 values 3 0 0 1
